  "_comment": [
    "Curated featured places for Direction C Discover grid (PR D2).",
    "ASCII-only. Edit by hand; queries_c.discover_grid() reads this at request time (cached).",
    "Schema (per place):",
    "  slug:        optional Provider.slug; when present, queries_c may join Provider for live hours_status.",
    "  name:        display name (required).",
    "  where:       short location line (optional).",
    "  image_url:   full Unsplash URL with sizing params (?w=N&q=85&auto=format&fit=crop).",
    "  image_attribution: optional {photographer, profile_url} for Unsplash license compliance.",
    "  span:        12 / 8 / 6 / 5 / 4 / 3 (CSS grid column count, required).",
    "  pick:        bool; renders the Hava's pick star ribbon (default false).",
    "  blurb:       long description for hero cards (span-8 / span-12), optional.",
    "  meta_line:   short meta line below name (optional).",
    "  status:      pill state class: open / closing / closed / scenic / neutral.",
    "  status_text: pill text content; null hides the pill.",
    "Acceptance: 10 places (5 masonry rows) renders 6-12 cards per spec."
  ],
